{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whispering Fog is a first person psychological horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a mysterious ever-changing forest of enroaching fog, a quiet getaway becomes a sinister nightmare as the illusion of safety and solitude slowly crumbles around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game builds tension over time to create a dreadful and terrifying experience, dripping with atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751236428\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Environment and Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether by supernatural forces, cryptid interference, or deteriorating sanity, this once peaceful forest grows more unsettling each night. Venture to and explore the varying points of interest throughout these woods and complete your nightly tasks, if you dare to step outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/envirogifs-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1751236428\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Lurks in the Woods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You aren't alone. Something stalks you from just out of sight and slowly creeps closer, biding its time and growing bolder throughout the nights. It will make its presence known and break down any semblance of security you think you might have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800140/extras/horrorlibraryhero.png?t=1751236428\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800140?t=1751236428","background_raw":"https:/